          "settings": {
            "category": "Product & Care",
            "title": "How is Bleusalt sustainable?",
            "text": "<p>We are sustainable in many ways.  Our material is made sustainably through a closed-loop process wherein chemicals do not leech into the environment. Our clothing production process is zero-waste, and we always reuse scrap fabric. We promote slow fashion by creating quality basics that are made to last.</p>",
            "page": ""
