        "83261d4a-257c-4631-a239-feb6bcea23a6": {
          "type": "FAQ",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Shipping & Returns",
            "title": "Can I preorder an item so I can make sure I get it before it sells out?",
            "text": "<p>While you can't preorder, you <em>can</em> be notified when your item returns to stock. A pop-up will prompt you to add your name and email when you try to order a currently out of stock item so you can be notified.</p>",
            "page": ""
